---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="You're In | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Your First 50 Subscribers guide is on its way."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <p class="ty-eyebrow">You're in</p>
      <h1 class="ty-headline">Hell yeah! Your guide is on its way.</h1>
      <p class="ty-subhead">Check your inbox in the next few minutes — that's where your First 50 Subscribers guide is headed.</p>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>While you wait, here's a head start: the very first real step in the guide is picking your platform. I use Beehiiv, and it's what I'd pick again if I were starting today — solid analytics, a built-in referral system, and they don't take a cut of your paid subscriptions.</p>
        <p>If you sign up now, you'll already be set up by the time your guide lands.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-cta">
        <p>If you sign up through my link and use the code <strong class="coupon">MIGRATE</strong>, you get 20% off your first three months.</p>
        <a
          href="https://www.beehiiv.com?via=MIGRATE"
          class="btn"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Start on Beehiiv &rarr;
        </a>
        <p class="cta-note">Free plan available. Affiliate link — I earn a small commission at no cost to you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>Talk soon,<br />Corey</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ty-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ty-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ty-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ty-subhead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ty-container .prose {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ty-container .inline-cta {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .cta-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }
</style>
